          "quote": "晚上睡觉也不踏实"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by sleep disturbance and perioperative context, but the model did not actively elicit under-disclosed sleep-breathing, comorbidity, or anesthesia-assessment factors or integrate them into the follow-up plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
