          "quote": "把药袋递给医生看"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by unclear papers and scattered medication information. The doctor helped with drug-bag handling and notes, but did not create the case-defined privacy-preserving packet covering CT, endoscopy, discharge/clinic notes, labs, and coagulation/lupus-anticoagulant-related tests.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
